meta {
  name: 03 notes
  seq: 4
}

docs {
  The fenced sample module's CRUD journey, end to end through the preview: create,
  read, list, replace, delete, and read-after-delete. Every request carries the
  machine token acquired in `00-auth`.

  DEPENDS ON the Note controller, which is owned by another worker on this node.
  The shapes asserted here follow `Lib/Note/NotePrincipal.cs` — `{ id, record: {
  title, body } }` — and the `AtomiController` contract from the server engine's
  usage skill: `Resolve` answers 200 with the value, `ResolveEmpty` answers 204.
}
